From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Ericson <John.Ericson@Obsidian.Systems>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 01:41:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tools/sgs: forward `COMPAT_DIR` and `COMPAT_SUPPORT_SRC` to
 the sub-makes

`tools/sgs/Makefile` already forwards `ROOTONBLD` and `ONBLD_TOOLS` explicitly,
because both have defaults and a value given on this make's command line
therefore does not reach the sub-makes. `COMPAT_DIR` and `COMPAT_SUPPORT_SRC`
are in exactly that position and were not forwarded, so they could not be
overridden at all.

That is not hypothetical. `Makefile.com` puts `$(COMPAT_CPPFLAGS)` -- which is
spelled in terms of `$(COMPAT_DIR)` -- into every sub-directory's `CPPFLAGS`,
and `libconv/Makefile` compiles `$(COMPAT_SUPPORT_SRC)` into
`native_support.o`. Both default to `$(SRC)/tools/libcompat`, so a build that
wants to supply libcompat from somewhere else -- already built, rather than
compiled again inside this tree -- had no way to say so.

Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5 (claude-opus-5)
---
 usr/src/tools/sgs/Makefile | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/usr/src/tools/sgs/Makefile b/usr/src/tools/sgs/Makefile
index 0e30f96950..854308cca0 100644
--- a/usr/src/tools/sgs/Makefile
+++ b/usr/src/tools/sgs/Makefile
@@ -42,7 +42,16 @@ all install clean clobber: $(SUBDIRS)
 # matters because libconv and friends run the sgsmsg built here, and find it
 # under $(ONBLD_TOOLS)/bin/$(MACH).
 #
+# COMPAT_DIR and COMPAT_SUPPORT_SRC (both set by Makefile.tools) are forwarded
+# for the same reason, and it is not hypothetical: Makefile.com puts
+# $(COMPAT_CPPFLAGS) in every sub-directory's CPPFLAGS, and libconv compiles
+# $(COMPAT_SUPPORT_SRC) into native_support.o.  Both name $(SRC)/tools/libcompat
+# by default, so a build that supplies libcompat from somewhere else -- already
+# built, rather than compiled again here -- has to be able to say so on this
+# make's command line and have it reach the sub-makes.
+#
 $(SUBDIRS): FRC
-	@cd $@; pwd; $(MAKE) $(TARGET) $(ROOTONBLD:%=ROOTONBLD=%) $(ONBLD_TOOLS:%=ONBLD_TOOLS=%)
+	@cd $@; pwd; $(MAKE) $(TARGET) $(ROOTONBLD:%=ROOTONBLD=%) $(ONBLD_TOOLS:%=ONBLD_TOOLS=%) \
+	    $(COMPAT_DIR:%=COMPAT_DIR=%) $(COMPAT_SUPPORT_SRC:%=COMPAT_SUPPORT_SRC=%)
 
 FRC:
